---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/common/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/common/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Marketing and design in Austria | Pop Digital Solutions" 
  description="Clear brand identity, coherent design, easy-to-understand content and selected marketing measures for companies in Austria.">
  
  <Header />

  <main>
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; width: 100%; overflow-x: hidden; padding-top: 140px; background-color: #ffffff;">
      
      <!-- HERO SECTION -->
      <section style="width: 100%; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 60px 20px;">
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; align-items: center;" class="md-grid-2">
          
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px;">
            <h1 style="font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: bold; color: #0f172a; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0;">
              Reexaminăm website-ul dumneavoastră fără a renunța inutil la ceea ce funcționează deja.
            </h1>
            <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
              Website-ul nu mai corespunde companiei, pare depășit tehnic sau vizual, sau nu mai susține obiectivele actuale? Analizăm ce există și stabilim ce poate fi păstrat, ce trebuie îmbunătățit și ce trebuie reconstruit.
            </p>
            <div style="margin-top: 16px;">
              <button style="background-color: #2563eb; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; padding: 16px 40px; border-radius: 9999px; border: none; font-size: 1.125rem; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
                Evaluare gratuită
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; position: relative;">
            <div style="width: 300px; height: 300px; border-radius: 50%; overflow: hidden; border: 8px solid #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); background-color: #eff6ff;">
              <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573496359142-b8d87734a5a2?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Hero Person" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: top;" />
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
      <section style="width: 100%; background-color: #f8fafc; border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;">
        <div style="width: 100%; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 20px; text-align: center;">
          <h2 style="font-size: 2.25rem; font-weight: bold; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 48px 0;">
            Cum funcționează
          </h2>
          <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px;" class="md-grid-3">
            
            <div style="background: #ffffff; border-radius: 24px; padding: 32px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;">
              <div style="width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #3b82f6; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 24px;">
                <svg style="width: 32px; height: 32px; color: #ffffff;" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z"></path></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: bold; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Informații personale</h3>
              <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">Setați datele de bază pentru a începe scanarea și verificarea sigură și eficientă.</p>
            </div>

            <div style="background: #ffffff; border-radius: 24px; padding: 32px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;">
              <div style="width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #22d3ee; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 24px;">
                <svg style="width: 32px; height: 32px; color: #ffffff;" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"></path><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: bold; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Locație</h3>
              <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">Selectați de unde doriți să preluați rezultatele specifice și locale pentru evaluare.</p>
            </div>

            <div style="background: #ffffff; border-radius: 24px; padding: 32px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;">
              <div style="width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #93c5fd; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 24px;">
                <svg style="width: 32px; height: 32px; color: #ffffff;" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"></path></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: bold; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Analiză profundă</h3>
              <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">Instrumentul nostru avansat vă va oferi un plan complet structurat într-un timp scurt.</p>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- FEATURE BLOCKS -->
      <section style="width: 100%; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 20px;">
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 80px;">
          
          <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; align-items: center;" class="md-grid-2">
            <div style="width: 100%; height: 350px; border-radius: 24px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); order: 2;" class="md-order-1">
              <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551288049-bebda4e38f71?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Dashboard" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;" />
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; order: 1;" class="md-order-2">
              <h2 style="font-size: 2rem; font-weight: bold; color: #0f172a; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0;">
                <span style="color: #2563eb;">Identificarea</span> URL-urilor și conținuturilor relevante
              </h2>
              <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
                Dacă se modifică structura, conținutul sau tehnologia, migrarea este planificată de la început.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; align-items: center;" class="md-grid-2">
            <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;">
              <h2 style="font-size: 2rem; font-weight: bold; color: #0f172a; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0;">
                <span style="color: #2563eb;">Controlul</span> legăturilor interne, titlurilor, etichetelor canonice și indexării
              </h2>
              <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
                Aceste măsuri reduc riscurile tehnice cunoscute. Nu pot fi garantate poziții în motoarele de căutare, volume de trafic sau rezultate comerciale.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div style="width: 100%; height: 350px; border-radius: 24px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
              <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531482615713-2afd69097998?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Strategy" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;" />
            </div>
          </div>
          
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- TESTIMONIAL -->
      <section style="width: 100%; background-color: #f8fafc; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 80px 20px;">
        <div style="width: 100%; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;">
          <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; align-items: center;" class="md-grid-2">
            
            <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px;">
              <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background-color: #2563eb; border-radius: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
                <svg style="width: 24px; height: 24px; color: #ffffff;" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10h-9.983zm-14.017 0v-7.391c0-5.704 3.748-9.57 9-10.609l.996 2.151c-2.433.917-3.996 3.638-3.996 5.849h3.983v10h-9.983z" /></svg>
              </div>
              <h2 style="font-size: 2.25rem; font-weight: bold; color: #0f172a; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0;">
                Ce spun <br/> <span style="color: #2563eb;">utilizatorii despre noi</span>
              </h2>
              <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; color: #475569; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; max-width: 400px;">
                O platformă concepută pentru a ajuta la clarificarea pașilor următori în mod structurat și sigur.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div style="background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 24px; padding: 40px; box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; position: relative;">
              <div style="width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 50%; border: 4px solid #ffffff; overflow: hidden; background-color: #e2e8f0; position: absolute; top: -32px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1438761681033-6461ffad8d80?q=80&w=2070&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Gabriel Pop" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;" />
              </div>
              <div style="color: #3b82f6; font-family: serif; font-size: 4rem; line-height: 1; opacity: 0.2; margin-top: 16px;">"</div>
              <p style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 500; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.6; margin: 8px 0 24px 0;">
                Procesul de relansare și optimizare a fost extrem de clar și structurat. Echipa a știut exact ce trebuie păstrat și ce trebuie optimizat.
              </p>
              <div style="font-weight: bold; color: #0f172a; font-size: 0.875rem;">Gabriel Pop</div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>

  <style>
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .md-grid-2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr !important; }
      .md-grid-3 { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr !important; }
      .md-order-1 { order: 1 !important; }
      .md-order-2 { order: 2 !important; }
    }
  </style>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
